@startuml
skinparam componentStyle uml2
component "Browser interface" as UI
package "Backend application — modular monolith (draft)" {
component "HTTP API and access control" as API
component "Identity and sessions" as Identity
component "Specialist directory" as Directory
component "Request workflow" as Requests
component "Reviews and ratings" as Reviews
component "Complaints and moderation" as Complaints
API --> Identity
API --> Directory
API --> Requests
API --> Reviews
API --> Complaints
Reviews ..> Requests : verify ownership and completion
Complaints ..> Reviews : change publication status
}
database "Relational database" as DB
UI --> API : HTTPS requests / responses
Identity --> DB
Directory --> DB
Requests --> DB
Reviews --> DB
Complaints --> DB
note bottom of DB
Unique constraint: one review per request.
Transactions and server-side permissions.
Technology choices remain pending.
end note
@enduml
